            "sid": "NUM 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore ti alo ilayiok le Merari nkena ninche anaa too lmareita lenye, o too nkajijik oo loo menye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebaiki ilarin tomoni uni neilep o metabaiki ilarin onom. Nkena ninche pooki ng'ae ake ninye oidim enkisiaayiare, pee eas esiaai ti atua ilo ng'obor le ntumo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa ena apa eitanapaki ninche metaasa, anaa esiaai enye pooki ti atua ilo ng'obor le ntumo; nena rubat oo sunta o lng'obor le Nkai, te nebo nkeek enyena, ing'apeta o nkitotoneta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "o ng'apeta e ilo goriet omanita te nebo nkitotoneta, o ncheito, o nkeenta te nebo imasaa enyena pooki o ntelon enyena pooki. Nioriki aipotoki nena masaa naaishiakino ninche nenap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ena ninye enkisiaayiare oolmareita loo layiok le Merari, ninye enkisiaayiare enye nalulung'a ti atua ilo ng'obor le ntumo ti abori enkitasheikinoto e Itamar olayioni le Aron ilo apolosani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.4.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
