          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ebaiki ilarin tomoni uni neilep ometabaiki ilarin onom, pooki ng'ae ake ninye oidim atijing'a enkisiaayiare neasisho anap ilolan ti atua ilo ng'obor le ntumo, ",
